          "acquisitionScope": "Whole unchanged ordinary1dc/P: specify the counted molecules/atoms/ions/formula units, distinguish entity and constituent counts, use mol unambiguously and reject equal-amount implies equal-mass. The existing one-card d7/008 unit reinforces recall after this instruction; a card alone does not teach or certify the whole ordinary skill."
